{'symbol': 'MAR', 'date': '2019-11-06 22:30:00', 'title': 'MARRIOTT INTERNATIONAL, INC. DECLARES QUARTERLY CASH DIVIDEND, PAYABLE ON DECEMBER 31, 2019', 'text': 'MARRIOTT INTERNATIONAL, INC. ANNOUNCED THAT ITS BOARD OF DIRECTORS DECLARED A QUARTERLY CASH DIVIDEND OF 48 CENTS PER SHARE OF COMMON STOCK. THE DIVIDEND IS PAYABLE ON DECEMBER 31, 2019 TO SHAREHOLDERS OF RECORD AS OF NOVEMBER 21, 2019.'}